    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Meet Our Orthodontics Team"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Meet The Dublin, CA, Orthodontics Team Of Dante Gonzales Orthodontics"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We are especially interested in making all our patients feel right at home! We put your needs first to achieve efficient and comprehensive treatment. Our staff is trained and skilled, and we strive to provide energetic and fun-loving service to each patient. Each member of our treatment team is a registered dental assistant, and our office staff has years of experience in treating patients with the highest level of care. We strive to stay abreast of the latest in technological advances by regularly attending continuing education courses and seminars."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-01.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Diana"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Office Manager"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Diana has been in the dental field since 1991. Her attention to detail and years of administrative experience aids her in acquainting new patients with our practice while building a positive orthodontic experience. Family is priority with Diana, that includes “9” grandchildren. Her love of the outdoors is obvious by her time spent horseback riding, biking riding, hiking, and RV camping."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-02.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Javona"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Scheduling Coordinator"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Javona lives in Fremont and has been in the dental field since 2002. Javona will most likely be one of the first voices you hear when calling our office. She is well versed in dental and administrative knowledge and is always happy to answer any questions you may have. On her down time she loves spending time with her family and summers at lake."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-03.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Leo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Registered Dental Assistant"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Leo graduated from Western Career College in 2006 and has his RDA and OA license. Making you laugh at your visit is one of Leo’s specialties. He loves singing at the chair side while you are waiting for doctor to check you. In his free time he loves going to different and exploring all the new restaurants."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-04.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Colleen"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Clinical Supervisor/ RDA"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Colleen has enjoyed her career as a Registered Dental Assistant in Orthodontics since 1984. She completed her assisting program at the College of Alameda. With Colleen’s dental knowledge, she is bound to have the answers to any of your questions. She is also a mother of four and proud that her only daughter decided to follow in her footsteps, as an orthodontic assistant. Colleen is an avid animal lover and loves working in her garden."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-05.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Michele"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Financial/ Scheduling Coordinator"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Michele has been in the dental field since 2008 and has over 30 years of customer service experience. Michele is dedicated to helping you navigate your insurance benefits as well as finding a time to schedule your follow up appointments. She is a Disney enthusiast who enjoys spending time with her husband, two children, and Newfoundland dogs."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-06.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Derrick"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Scheduling Coordinator"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Derrick started in sales in 2012 and joined our practice in 2018. He is most likely one of the first voices you will hear and meet. As your treatment coordinator he will help you navigate through your first visits. Derrick is also well versed in helping you maximize you insurance benefits. In his leisure he likes to go hiking, running, and spending with his dog Bella."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/team/team-photo-07.png",
      "alt": "",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Berenice"
    },
    {
